Z||000004||fropuff||03-05-2001||05:21 PM||||Well, that's what I'm thinking.  There still is snow here, but the roads are relatively dry and free of road slop.  I have to first identify and fix the overheating problem, but then I might drive it; this year only though.  I want to keep it strictly as a summer car.  I will drive it until fall until I buy another vehicle; I might need to get a summer job, but that's okay.  I'm thinking something front wheel drive.  I kind of feel bad, but I can't really do anything about it.  I will try to find out what I can get for it.  If I can't get much, I might keep it and try to find a cheap 350 to enter it into an enduro-race.  Thanks!!||||reg||1
